   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Puts the face from a photo into a new picture (PuLID). Lighter touch than InstantID: the pose and style follow the prompt freely.\nThe input picture is a clear photo of ONE face. Method: fidelity = closest likeness, style = more stylised, neutral = in between.\nWeight 0.8–1.0. Works with most SDXL checkpoints; lightning / turbo ones need fewer steps.\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 6.0, dpmpp_2m / sgm_uniform."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
